{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "2989d0a9a9437a1e1f47167a3282006bb2017503076192ad400e61a43237f0af",
  "bundle_request_count": 24,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:1ccff7bd6ae85dd974ab393217cd2633a5a87f7d19b4d84b070371570378f660",
      "request_id": "1ccff7bd6ae85dd974ab393217cd2633a5a87f7d19b4d84b070371570378f660",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ff01211795a45b770a553aad2bc61958",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抢七里，冠军点又一个一个溜走。五个冠军点，他一个都没抓住——比赛被拖进了第三盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e13eee0995caa8c1742c5968f9b68f17dc4db5fb884f6a4bb3a372d40f38ac7d",
      "words_sha256": "37575361e5e91e7f39c49d7af9dfec1bb6bb666f75cde16cbfb8572a860789bf"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:33f2b2ef1738790196fe274a04d4ee9118076d2d1feaa76abd08038d73001535",
      "request_id": "33f2b2ef1738790196fe274a04d4ee9118076d2d1feaa76abd08038d73001535",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "15a39aa56c6a2b529f522ae6f782ba25",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "你觉得，这个冠军是他重回前五的起点，还是又要等下一个四年？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "34aae927bd39f18e531da9516bda278fb898d49f29072cecd0fa0eb29bd75b7c",
      "words_sha256": "9c4a30d322ba5d9ca30a18c97b1df240a525c0ab02f8bd47a0578280b64a2bb6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:431fe5deb112186581d8d57f400d2e58baac3c8d427e8695a3d0ef201cdf1abc",
      "request_id": "431fe5deb112186581d8d57f400d2e58baac3c8d427e8695a3d0ef201cdf1abc",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d715290ccb9812191704607d5c7aac9e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛的对手弗里茨，整周 31 个发球局一个没丢。穆塞蒂在他的第一个发球局，就完成了破发。他的办法还是那一套：单手反拍不断变线、变节奏，放小球、拉高弧线，把一台发球机器拖进他最不舒服的回合里。6 比 3、6 比 4，81 分钟，他全场没有面对过一个破发点，在第一个赛点上，结束了四年的等待。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f615f98d27d6a3cbaef270020f5938da6028de2ee0f89620024e430037a9aea2",
      "words_sha256": "6def7cd234607dd0e7c6bcb0dd4ca7945fa0ad5fc69ab0909a7c68b419990556"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:45de5a650cbf0fa5b9beee73181a7feeff805dca10e799e3b07cd75c631deded",
      "request_id": "45de5a650cbf0fa5b9beee73181a7feeff805dca10e799e3b07cd75c631deded",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e5e3d6f86a01b4fae724208793e4c33a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这一周在里昂，他先打了一场三个半小时、到凌晨一点的球——生涯第 200 胜。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "722b2ededd86505bade7f599418eba9ba121ae3c64f847aedadcad54b6362a5c",
      "words_sha256": "f4e2771356a021e4a448d6f33b59165bb07495b5bb029eaafb0d31a07d82eaed"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:694bc37567eab12d7dfdec065300a0de35ec5ad3328b5a622dec9664cf91dbdc",
      "request_id": "694bc37567eab12d7dfdec065300a0de35ec5ad3328b5a622dec9664cf91dbdc",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "db5c8f306a44f0b736f96e10ea3bb91d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2024 年成都，他输给了商竣程。第三次决赛，第三次看着别人捧杯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ee2609ec2891f7249ae45c64c739443058bc5abbd2c29878a67c12bdbfd4a8d0",
      "words_sha256": "d1501e333f73fecc48697f2b3b9a54040e3aa6490be6bd50a1addaa865aa544b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:69a078aaea44f02ff88413e936d5f04d57d649268588d81a9a900c4ed219ca3f",
      "request_id": "69a078aaea44f02ff88413e936d5f04d57d649268588d81a9a900c4ed219ca3f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0709480556e87d5f722a8e39abee0dc7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2022 年在汉堡，他说：我还在做梦。四年、七场决赛之后，在里昂，他说了几乎同一句话：这个梦，我不想醒来。24 岁的穆塞蒂，武器从来不是问题，问题一直是健康，和决赛里最后那一口气。现在这口气，他在里昂续上了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "690fdce4f2ecf1ef55f42aa63a757223440c3927ab88c1b97cf97a466ed5c5f8",
      "words_sha256": "a16376331d0f83d92dbd69872c513bc02727fc97fd7e010c88f4f3675e905359"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:71384dd2d03c7d8c2e64c21e2f455d33d5481cc540ddd65a3a21ba9773882b23",
      "request_id": "71384dd2d03c7d8c2e64c21e2f455d33d5481cc540ddd65a3a21ba9773882b23",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f45353764f5512d78f14e782d67b72dd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三个月后，那不勒斯，他直落两盘击败贝雷蒂尼。两次决赛，两座冠军。谁都觉得，他的冠军会一个接一个来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7aaa45e3aed3819f36534ca9a0037ef2ed25b0f3f28c42529d1e4f8b3e019f53",
      "words_sha256": "3c9ce2af7f9b219239edc1aca15fd649ead07c682148fa044d256ea974bb1a4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:815b1df286f5a5dc28ab6b45e4b288652d53a7e9c5fe5b2bb99f0c82e735ca03",
      "request_id": "815b1df286f5a5dc28ab6b45e4b288652d53a7e9c5fe5b2bb99f0c82e735ca03",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1dfb691ef50e9ae5c97bbb5f812af386",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2026 年 1 月香港，他输给布勃利克，巡回赛决赛七连败。吊诡的是，就在那一周，他的世界排名升到了生涯最高的第五。排名越爬越高的人，奖杯柜却四年没有添过一件东西。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b7dead5bd590bdccc09c45c9c271f67650fe46396a820ec89d3f6b90c7ea64f3",
      "words_sha256": "75aac60e534ad602c77e9172bbe9e15c8248c3f6866144ba36a669164b708c6d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:962f62f41b0a5dca1d439ef8b34ddd338e9d59289589863d8b4ba7ec2e6bced0",
      "request_id": "962f62f41b0a5dca1d439ef8b34ddd338e9d59289589863d8b4ba7ec2e6bced0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c2f543f84df84d75a0709f77739e5dce",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛对头号种子科博利，他先丢一盘。决胜盘 4 比 5，他的发球局，15 比 40。两个赛点，压在头顶。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "17db9b21f5e868aba2a7072c0e7344a96067e274a4a869cde5a0577e8549b37f",
      "words_sha256": "6c0890cd9207a86ee41ea55cbb2b4d5b1dca5f6e1f8aa52752e19f1ec67e288f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a52d1f12b562edac12f1f70690d1b051637d1a7207a75e63a934ea024ac99b01",
      "request_id": "a52d1f12b562edac12f1f70690d1b051637d1a7207a75e63a934ea024ac99b01",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "90313cd1ebb34e220b93ba74aee00094",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "里昂，2026 年 10 月 25 日。穆塞蒂 6 比 3、6 比 4 击败弗里茨——他上一次捧杯，还是四年前。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a3f7bc461a79d3ff8b1438c368833c64bce25c197ab0f09122c5283d6cb0e1a8",
      "words_sha256": "828ec9045b9acdaf8296e07903edae84b599341bd45a1da866cc163b1f26ebc9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b75b19e662b531b59d4b46b329a3e9786422a5648bd48beea2f22d6419a7410f",
      "request_id": "b75b19e662b531b59d4b46b329a3e9786422a5648bd48beea2f22d6419a7410f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "064aa08c52e92bd57198701fb1ec70cd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "0 比 3 时他叫了医疗暂停，最后几乎是拖着一条腿打完的。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3cd22479bf59c97bc5d346dac978f073ebc813a8f4dae7663223b9a041c203f4",
      "words_sha256": "a1c4d3756c762682a487bb2d970d91e4b9d4c2dd5a3374444f1ca2d0458ea22d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "899efa7147920f60e3cf0dd46b92f9c64a00a0dac121890f1ac340102ae8203c",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b9518b50da558c97792aab7d8cf78490cf2aaa441ebdd7e1e9d947a3d64c9c90",
      "request_id": "b9518b50da558c97792aab7d8cf78490cf2aaa441ebdd7e1e9d947a3d64c9c90",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bff6d2c07b6d14b6fb83994e6df8d7b1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一个月后的乌马格，他先赢一盘，决胜盘抢七，最后一分落地，塞伦多洛倒在了地上。穆塞蒂，又是亚军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "9c2eb9cc79c91ddea4cdae5edfc8ddee93330e9dd3b57c10ead3fb1e366deadd",
      "words_sha256": "e78546ed36d2c245e686c432cda03b5cfe32644f73fbd1f5fe889cbf951387c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:bd3325ce026196d02ae29cbf4f9b1c65c1058456067afc42c49539d43f72ff3f",
      "request_id": "bd3325ce026196d02ae29cbf4f9b1c65c1058456067afc42c49539d43f72ff3f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "41e495117ac13b54b60de4410a2604c3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "七次决赛，七次亚军；四年冠军荒终结。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6689831d962ee67721e90a073de47e190339a7ebcb24cf4694a95d40b9b67dac",
      "words_sha256": "943a3b13da7bfd16671af5995c342bc2d413e623c35dd45682b94c6ce731a426"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c0b9e7c808bfaa3333e7d993ffffe624e3b58431b794d4dd4c19e2664c619e0e",
      "request_id": "c0b9e7c808bfaa3333e7d993ffffe624e3b58431b794d4dd4c19e2664c619e0e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7ee7beab797582011517042c27556038",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2025 年雅典，他把德约科维奇逼到决胜盘 5 比 5。那一站他必须赢才能直通都灵——他还是差了一口气。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1c2706dd964a708d2488bb76f93d338fafef94d4a80457688df00a8128978365",
      "words_sha256": "2efdbbb1029ed7644ad79cd8fc0ee34745f544430783b5a1bc84e016b081b257"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c3836c8badb4889e49d665b349d4dd82a04b7340fc7e1c932830dd41b1b46364",
      "request_id": "c3836c8badb4889e49d665b349d4dd82a04b7340fc7e1c932830dd41b1b46364",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b18c73bac2b2f297ace2808f6ba272f3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可下一次捧杯，一等就是四年。2024 年女王杯，他输给保罗。那一年他其实打进了温网四强、拿了奥运铜牌——他不是打得不好，他只是赢不了最后一场。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "11a485da4cfcc1c64e5fe33a4ea1a0deefb02a1a5ba35f7c5212e4d57018bdcb",
      "words_sha256": "b373be4a610dc827801f09d0b2d69288ea85eac0ceb352a73983b2b9f18d190f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:d8fb899bb13539ad722b982b1370a606e15982bf32794d30f2cc1e0d0e4a2c1b",
      "request_id": "d8fb899bb13539ad722b982b1370a606e15982bf32794d30f2cc1e0d0e4a2c1b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "37ab35a36388afd97d1597630eeab9ee",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "去年在成都，是别人的冠军点从他手里活了过来；这一次，活过来的是他自己。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "95a361f5c2160886b49bb9ca06c0b40f742232519481a3fcd9a857be601c1226",
      "words_sha256": "6a80e1b5391c6fee010ee3c0c0e7f5cff101d6d07d5c221cb3491612a6763db0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e79c83c8e09d62f98e35206f2fbb05238b167833fe0fd2ca02f8fdf0ffc657f4",
      "request_id": "e79c83c8e09d62f98e35206f2fbb05238b167833fe0fd2ca02f8fdf0ffc657f4",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3c97be1a3bdb64f6cc25a24aa8884a48",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "那天的赛后采访里，他说：我没法形容现在的感受——我还在做梦。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c8926ff220cb8111b8d69df38d240c78a27d3192ad06e833f37cd2839bb396ec",
      "words_sha256": "415944855c11206b1127447d07c554f32ad27a5063401f1bd94b5fff3f0507c3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ec082269269802c49f3477d04aa106e7e977482e0294f50dcb9900e8d6284b27",
      "request_id": "ec082269269802c49f3477d04aa106e7e977482e0294f50dcb9900e8d6284b27",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c8ff1d06616c96e073b8dc160ab457a2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年五月，他在罗马伤了大腿，法网、温网全退了，排名掉到二十六。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "cf8ee7a9ecd7c0c114a13073ee2ca296c14edd52875eb570ba143119641fc4fd",
      "words_sha256": "efff105e64328d80e1991466b73433bef92bd12d9c04811a2212edb2449805ec"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ec1aac7aa82243e2d9bed2ee065e727a143ff311a297d2b9ec8d01ef5bcff97d",
      "request_id": "ec1aac7aa82243e2d9bed2ee065e727a143ff311a297d2b9ec8d01ef5bcff97d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "880aa7596fd346ccf8ee8dded2017440",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2022 年汉堡，他 19 岁，第一次打进巡回赛决赛，对手是阿尔卡拉斯。第二盘，他自己的发球胜赛局。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "54d85d7631c17b9987bef8d725971e526cc59862a871250a2069eaccf8e78064",
      "words_sha256": "d91e87ee17665b2c843008fa727cf434ec4156474b78101f681a3e325d15c3f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f9209e308d19dcf9b71db9af3789e666ed0dff84955badd500d8f25c00df93d7",
      "request_id": "f9209e308d19dcf9b71db9af3789e666ed0dff84955badd500d8f25c00df93d7",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c992ab6dab6209ab650885940774e01f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抢七，他 4 比 1 领先，还是输了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3152a59239fdf00dee49d13ccfac69b322784bb1d89337252f5fb99d70d56215",
      "words_sha256": "fb7feac41c766be83b90e07d7f1af6a2ffb81c0a16850bdd6bb9f920b8273b16"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:fa78fe64b9247e08d588b5f8d671955262384f4ab7450c5900c63029b86a0d3a",
      "request_id": "fa78fe64b9247e08d588b5f8d671955262384f4ab7450c5900c63029b86a0d3a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ea557fa894c69a36f2b68ff5281b1f3b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "后来变成四个赛点。一个一个，他全救了下来，然后破发，拿下比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "965f410ff62e65d9d735a48a18630c249cdfe65cce9651557d505d3fbc60a8b4",
      "words_sha256": "e55f356f67004079575bc23999601ce2aed2d3e3b169cf77d7a89c3783a8281a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:fb6a47d8355a1f8cdd1acb576f68e23b5b7834adbcba6e0c84e22eabd5f05593",
      "request_id": "fb6a47d8355a1f8cdd1acb576f68e23b5b7834adbcba6e0c84e22eabd5f05593",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "13c4f8e178c365ff930a13aa05242c6f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半年后又回成都，这一次最痛。决胜盘，他手里握着两个冠军点，被世界排名 112 位的资格赛球员塔比洛，一个一个救了回来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "813eebd44bb22aa2d96694883a8f1df6623c9896f97de400ad871c39b7097654",
      "words_sha256": "54a88ee9f3f42d4705aee2837113f7678ecc91404d65b3b051cdb9f3acf69aeb"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:fcafc1c93d4133dfc28228bab94bd3e4a1336191a64705353991f156710debce",
      "request_id": "fcafc1c93d4133dfc28228bab94bd3e4a1336191a64705353991f156710debce",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "495048262dd706450f242b79ab1125c1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2025 年蒙特卡洛，他第一次站上大师赛决赛，先赢一盘。可第三盘，他的右腿撑不住了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8f1b94e64849ea6c3c8fe3c7177e37d358b58b29348736d451d52e4f09684cc6",
      "words_sha256": "632df18a61912f650c39a5fa78bd73c838ce7880d7d6cf873162cf7bf2ca4e5e"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a3f7bc461a79d3ff8b1438c368833c64bce25c197ab0f09122c5283d6cb0e1a8",
      "words_sha256": "828ec9045b9acdaf8296e07903edae84b599341bd45a1da866cc163b1f26ebc9",
      "words_path": "voice_01.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "90313cd1ebb34e220b93ba74aee00094",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "里昂，2026 年 10 月 25 日。穆塞蒂 6 比 3、6 比 4 击败弗里茨——他上一次捧杯，还是四年前。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "54d85d7631c17b9987bef8d725971e526cc59862a871250a2069eaccf8e78064",
      "words_sha256": "d91e87ee17665b2c843008fa727cf434ec4156474b78101f681a3e325d15c3f2",
      "words_path": "voice_02.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "880aa7596fd346ccf8ee8dded2017440",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2022 年汉堡，他 19 岁，第一次打进巡回赛决赛，对手是阿尔卡拉斯。第二盘，他自己的发球胜赛局。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e13eee0995caa8c1742c5968f9b68f17dc4db5fb884f6a4bb3a372d40f38ac7d",
      "words_sha256": "37575361e5e91e7f39c49d7af9dfec1bb6bb666f75cde16cbfb8572a860789bf",
      "words_path": "voice_03.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ff01211795a45b770a553aad2bc61958",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抢七里，冠军点又一个一个溜走。五个冠军点，他一个都没抓住——比赛被拖进了第三盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c8926ff220cb8111b8d69df38d240c78a27d3192ad06e833f37cd2839bb396ec",
      "words_sha256": "415944855c11206b1127447d07c554f32ad27a5063401f1bd94b5fff3f0507c3",
      "words_path": "voice_04.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3c97be1a3bdb64f6cc25a24aa8884a48",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "那天的赛后采访里，他说：我没法形容现在的感受——我还在做梦。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7aaa45e3aed3819f36534ca9a0037ef2ed25b0f3f28c42529d1e4f8b3e019f53",
      "words_sha256": "3c9ce2af7f9b219239edc1aca15fd649ead07c682148fa044d256ea974bb1a4a",
      "words_path": "voice_05.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f45353764f5512d78f14e782d67b72dd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三个月后，那不勒斯，他直落两盘击败贝雷蒂尼。两次决赛，两座冠军。谁都觉得，他的冠军会一个接一个来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "11a485da4cfcc1c64e5fe33a4ea1a0deefb02a1a5ba35f7c5212e4d57018bdcb",
      "words_sha256": "b373be4a610dc827801f09d0b2d69288ea85eac0ceb352a73983b2b9f18d190f",
      "words_path": "voice_06.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b18c73bac2b2f297ace2808f6ba272f3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可下一次捧杯，一等就是四年。2024 年女王杯，他输给保罗。那一年他其实打进了温网四强、拿了奥运铜牌——他不是打得不好，他只是赢不了最后一场。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "9c2eb9cc79c91ddea4cdae5edfc8ddee93330e9dd3b57c10ead3fb1e366deadd",
      "words_sha256": "e78546ed36d2c245e686c432cda03b5cfe32644f73fbd1f5fe889cbf951387c7",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bff6d2c07b6d14b6fb83994e6df8d7b1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一个月后的乌马格，他先赢一盘，决胜盘抢七，最后一分落地，塞伦多洛倒在了地上。穆塞蒂，又是亚军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ee2609ec2891f7249ae45c64c739443058bc5abbd2c29878a67c12bdbfd4a8d0",
      "words_sha256": "d1501e333f73fecc48697f2b3b9a54040e3aa6490be6bd50a1addaa865aa544b",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "db5c8f306a44f0b736f96e10ea3bb91d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2024 年成都，他输给了商竣程。第三次决赛，第三次看着别人捧杯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8f1b94e64849ea6c3c8fe3c7177e37d358b58b29348736d451d52e4f09684cc6",
      "words_sha256": "632df18a61912f650c39a5fa78bd73c838ce7880d7d6cf873162cf7bf2ca4e5e",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "495048262dd706450f242b79ab1125c1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2025 年蒙特卡洛，他第一次站上大师赛决赛，先赢一盘。可第三盘，他的右腿撑不住了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "3cd22479bf59c97bc5d346dac978f073ebc813a8f4dae7663223b9a041c203f4",
      "words_sha256": "a1c4d3756c762682a487bb2d970d91e4b9d4c2dd5a3374444f1ca2d0458ea22d",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "064aa08c52e92bd57198701fb1ec70cd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "0 比 3 时他叫了医疗暂停，最后几乎是拖着一条腿打完的。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "813eebd44bb22aa2d96694883a8f1df6623c9896f97de400ad871c39b7097654",
      "words_sha256": "54a88ee9f3f42d4705aee2837113f7678ecc91404d65b3b051cdb9f3acf69aeb",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "13c4f8e178c365ff930a13aa05242c6f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半年后又回成都，这一次最痛。决胜盘，他手里握着两个冠军点，被世界排名 112 位的资格赛球员塔比洛，一个一个救了回来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "3152a59239fdf00dee49d13ccfac69b322784bb1d89337252f5fb99d70d56215",
      "words_sha256": "fb7feac41c766be83b90e07d7f1af6a2ffb81c0a16850bdd6bb9f920b8273b16",
      "words_path": "voice_12.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c992ab6dab6209ab650885940774e01f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抢七，他 4 比 1 领先，还是输了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1c2706dd964a708d2488bb76f93d338fafef94d4a80457688df00a8128978365",
      "words_sha256": "2efdbbb1029ed7644ad79cd8fc0ee34745f544430783b5a1bc84e016b081b257",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7ee7beab797582011517042c27556038",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2025 年雅典，他把德约科维奇逼到决胜盘 5 比 5。那一站他必须赢才能直通都灵——他还是差了一口气。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b7dead5bd590bdccc09c45c9c271f67650fe46396a820ec89d3f6b90c7ea64f3",
      "words_sha256": "75aac60e534ad602c77e9172bbe9e15c8248c3f6866144ba36a669164b708c6d",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1dfb691ef50e9ae5c97bbb5f812af386",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2026 年 1 月香港，他输给布勃利克，巡回赛决赛七连败。吊诡的是，就在那一周，他的世界排名升到了生涯最高的第五。排名越爬越高的人，奖杯柜却四年没有添过一件东西。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "cf8ee7a9ecd7c0c114a13073ee2ca296c14edd52875eb570ba143119641fc4fd",
      "words_sha256": "efff105e64328d80e1991466b73433bef92bd12d9c04811a2212edb2449805ec",
      "words_path": "voice_15.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c8ff1d06616c96e073b8dc160ab457a2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年五月，他在罗马伤了大腿，法网、温网全退了，排名掉到二十六。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "722b2ededd86505bade7f599418eba9ba121ae3c64f847aedadcad54b6362a5c",
      "words_sha256": "f4e2771356a021e4a448d6f33b59165bb07495b5bb029eaafb0d31a07d82eaed",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e5e3d6f86a01b4fae724208793e4c33a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这一周在里昂，他先打了一场三个半小时、到凌晨一点的球——生涯第 200 胜。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "17db9b21f5e868aba2a7072c0e7344a96067e274a4a869cde5a0577e8549b37f",
      "words_sha256": "6c0890cd9207a86ee41ea55cbb2b4d5b1dca5f6e1f8aa52752e19f1ec67e288f",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c2f543f84df84d75a0709f77739e5dce",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛对头号种子科博利，他先丢一盘。决胜盘 4 比 5，他的发球局，15 比 40。两个赛点，压在头顶。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "965f410ff62e65d9d735a48a18630c249cdfe65cce9651557d505d3fbc60a8b4",
      "words_sha256": "e55f356f67004079575bc23999601ce2aed2d3e3b169cf77d7a89c3783a8281a",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ea557fa894c69a36f2b68ff5281b1f3b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "后来变成四个赛点。一个一个，他全救了下来，然后破发，拿下比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "95a361f5c2160886b49bb9ca06c0b40f742232519481a3fcd9a857be601c1226",
      "words_sha256": "6a80e1b5391c6fee010ee3c0c0e7f5cff101d6d07d5c221cb3491612a6763db0",
      "words_path": "voice_19.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "37ab35a36388afd97d1597630eeab9ee",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "去年在成都，是别人的冠军点从他手里活了过来；这一次，活过来的是他自己。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f615f98d27d6a3cbaef270020f5938da6028de2ee0f89620024e430037a9aea2",
      "words_sha256": "6def7cd234607dd0e7c6bcb0dd4ca7945fa0ad5fc69ab0909a7c68b419990556",
      "words_path": "voice_20.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d715290ccb9812191704607d5c7aac9e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛的对手弗里茨，整周 31 个发球局一个没丢。穆塞蒂在他的第一个发球局，就完成了破发。他的办法还是那一套：单手反拍不断变线、变节奏，放小球、拉高弧线，把一台发球机器拖进他最不舒服的回合里。6 比 3、6 比 4，81 分钟，他全场没有面对过一个破发点，在第一个赛点上，结束了四年的等待。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "690fdce4f2ecf1ef55f42aa63a757223440c3927ab88c1b97cf97a466ed5c5f8",
      "words_sha256": "a16376331d0f83d92dbd69872c513bc02727fc97fd7e010c88f4f3675e905359",
      "words_path": "voice_22.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0709480556e87d5f722a8e39abee0dc7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
